Package: com.keyword.smsalert
Name: KeywordSMSAlert
Version: 1.4.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Alerts (vibration + ringer-channel sound) when an incoming SMS matches a keyword. Detection, the alert engine and the event-driven power-button stop source all run inside one dylib injected into imagent: no SpringBoard injection, no launchd service, no extra process. Includes a Settings pane (needs PreferenceLoader) and the ksactl helper. Designed for Dopamine RootHide / roothide on iOS 15.4.1.
Maintainer: KeywordSMSAlert
Author: KeywordSMSAlert
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
